{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53021","headline":"题潘岳六城南庄庄是源赞善处 · 陈润","name":"题潘岳六城南庄庄是源赞善处","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"原公旧路唯三径，潘岳新年已二毛。\n（《千载佳句》卷上《人事部·闲居》）（按：《全唐诗逸》卷中误收此诗爲温达作，今移正。\n又《全唐诗逸》卷中据《文镜秘府论》天卷录陈闰《罢官後却归旧居诗》，别作一人，实误。\n陈闰应即陈润，《文苑英华》卷一五七、卷二九八录润诗皆作陈闰，可证。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈润","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}